  "term": "MMT",
  "definition": "MMT stands for methadone maintenance treatment, a methadone-based maintenance approach used for opioid use disorder. In this context, it refers to patients receiving ongoing methadone treatment, sometimes discussed alongside related sleep disturbances.",
